                <div class="window-title">conclusion.txt</div>
            </div>
            <div class="window-content blog-section">
                <h2>> Conclusion</h2>
                <p>By empowering individuals at the exact point of content consumption, VeriLens can meaningfully interrupt the misinformation cycle. Rather than expecting users to independently cross-reference fact-checking websites, VeriLens brings the truth directly to the visual web, helping users transition from simple awareness to active discernment.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

